# Configure Gemini through the project's protected secret input, not in this file.
# GEMINI_API_KEY is required by NOVA; never commit a real key.
# Optional: override the model used by server/science.ts.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-lite

# Optional NASA API key (the public DEMO_KEY is used when absent).
# NASA_API_KEY=
